    "detailed_description": "<h1>Custom Effect Creation</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit our webpage and download the PuppetMaster.Examples bundle, open it inside Unity 6 to create and export your own custom PuppetMaster Effects!\u00a0  </p></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PuppetMaster is a Twitch streaming tool meant to be downloaded and ran on the streaming machine, where Twitch Chatters can trigger effects directly on the Streamers machine for hilarious results!\u00a0\u00a0<br>\u00a0\u00a0<br>These effects are designed to be visible to both you and the stream, and originally the idea is to create effects that hinder the streamer from being able to play the game but any type of effect can be created to allow everyone to have a fun, engaging and entertaining time!\u00a0\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PuppetMaster is a Twitch streaming tool meant to be downloaded and ran on the streaming machine, where Twitch Chatters can trigger effects directly on the Streamers machine for hilarious results!\u00a0\u00a0<br>\u00a0\u00a0<br>These effects are designed to be visible to both you and the stream, and originally the idea is to create effects that hinder the streamer from being able to play the game but any type of effect can be created to allow everyone to have a fun, engaging and entertaining time!\u00a0\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "PuppetMaster, a Streamers vital tool for enabling wildly entertaining effects and to have your community to modify gaming sessions, Live!",
